// Article 4. Sale of an interest.
#require "1-members.charter".
Placeholder seller For person
Placeholder buyer For person
Function offered Identified by seller * usd
Fact accepted Identified by buyer * seller
Act offer-interest Actor seller Related to usd
  Holds when member(seller)
  Creates offered(seller, usd)
Power accept-offer Actor buyer Recipient seller
  Valid when member(buyer) && buyer != seller
    && (Exists offered: offered.seller == seller && !Held(offered) For 30 days)
  Creates accepted(buyer, seller)
Power sell-to-members Actor seller
  Holds when member(seller)
  Valid when (Exists offered: offered.seller == seller && Held(offered) For 30 days)
    && (Exists buyer: accepted(buyer, seller))
  Creates (Foreach capital: capital(capital.person, capital.int
              + MulDivRound(capital(seller), capital.int,
                            Sum(Foreach capital': capital'.int When accepted(capital'.person, seller)), Floor))
             When accepted(capital.person, seller))
        , capital(seller, 0)
  Terminates member(seller), (Foreach offered: offered When offered.seller == seller)
           , (Foreach buyer: accepted(buyer, seller))
Power sell-outside Actor seller Recipient buyer Related to usd
  Holds when member(seller)
  Valid when (Exists offered: offered.seller == seller && Held(offered) For 30 days && usd >= offered.usd)
    && !(Exists buyer': accepted(buyer', seller)) && member(buyer)
  Creates capital(buyer, capital(seller)), capital(seller, 0)
  Terminates member(seller), (Foreach offered: offered When offered.seller == seller)

Clause 4.1 => offer-interest, offered
Clause 4.2/1 => accept-offer
Clause 4.2/2 => sell-to-members
Clause 4.2/3 => sell-to-members
Clause 4.3 => sell-outside
Clause 4.4 => sell-to-members, sell-outside.
